  "description": "My crush is shorter than me! \n\nHa-Yan Yoon, a 17-year-old aspiring model, has been single her entire life. She believes her soulmate is out there, waiting for her. Then along comes a boy — a whole head shorter than her! — and suddenly, her world is pink and blooming with flowers. Could this be destiny? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
